<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT SWITZERLAND 1-0 IN A WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT SWITZERLAND 1-0 IN A WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE, Switzerland 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway beat</p>
<p>Switzerland 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup European group</p>
<p>three soccer qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Oyvind Leonhardsen 32</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,000</p>
<p>Group three standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Norway		 3   3   0   0   9   0   9</p>
<p> Switzerland	  3   1   0   2   3   4   3</p>
<p> Hungary		3   2   0   1   4   3   6</p>
<p> Azerbaijan	   3   1   0   2   1   8   3</p>
<p> Finland		2   0   0   2   2   4   0</p>
<p>Next match: April 2 Azerbaijan v Finland</p>
</text>
